{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a top-down shooter. You can control your character to move and shoot to defeat incoming enemies, dodge attacks and protect Chicken Brother until the end of the level time is a victory or a defeat. Enemies will appear in a queue from multiple angles and will fill the screen in arrays. Defeat enemies with a chance to drop gold and health regeneration items. Some levels will have some traps to increase the difficulty of the game.The game is a free demo version with only 8 levels to play. Two firearms are available for use, and the second weapon needs to be unlocked through the third level. Special buffs can be activated by standing in the rings of the level for a certain amount of time, which increase damage and increase gold gain.The free music resources used in the game can be viewed in the settings page.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754010?t=1748483770","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754010?t=1748483770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754010/4070f60d1fd8ba49d204767a035f52425164fb21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748483770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754010/4070f60d1fd8ba49d204767a035f52425164fb21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748483770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a top-down shooter. You can control your character to move and shoot to defeat incoming enemies, dodge attacks and protect Chicken Brother until the end of the level time is a victory or a defeat. Enemies will appear in a queue from multiple angles and will fill the screen in arrays. Defeat enemies with a chance to drop gold and health regeneration items. Some levels will have some traps to increase the difficulty of the game.The game is a free demo version with only 8 levels to play. Two firearms are available for use, and the second weapon needs to be unlocked through the third level. Special buffs can be activated by standing in the rings of the level for a certain amount of time, which increase damage and increase gold gain.The free music resources used in the game can be viewed in the settings page.</p>","developers":["Yaww"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3457140","name":"Chicken Brother Guardian"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754010/81fc3af56576fb5e4746a7feacd73a2173e5d316/header.jpg?t=1748483770","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257141006,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141006/movie480.mp4?t=1747893530","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141006/movie_max.mp4?t=1747893530"},"name":"ChickenBrotherVideo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141006/163c4ba3dd37d5de8bac1dbedb17f8250be97d25/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747893530","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141006/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747893530","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141006/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747893530"}}],"name":"Chicken Brother Guardian","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Yaww"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rat